  "lineage": "Late-1990s UK garage subgenre developed in London integrating Jamaican ragga-and-dancehall vocal-sampling and bass-line aesthetic with US deep-house production framework. Characterized by chopped-vocal samples, prominent rolling-bass, and the canonical Tuff Jam-Dreem Teem-MJ Cole DJ-and-production lineage. Direct precursor of 2-step UK garage and (through 2-step) UK grime, dubstep, and future garage.",
